  "details": "The vote kick system really need to get changed to get the great abusement redused as much as possible\n\nI recommend that a cool down is being added, so that each user will have to wait 1 hour or maybe more to be able to try start next vote kick but group owner can in their own group world have the unlimited kick and vote kick and give this option to other members in group to do the same in these worlds only\n\nThis method will not remove the option completely, just only nerf it and even if a user not get enough vote, then the user can ask some one else to try start it again and explained why blocking the person is not enough\n\nIf the issue that people group up on random users to vote kick them, then it don't help to have infinite tries to get rid of that group but the nerf will only change the fact in this case that it sure can help stop that group to vote kick random when all in that group already have tried and put a great limit on these abusers",
